/* Self-hosted btrc compiler — back-half driver.
 *
 * Composes the full pipeline (front-end -> lexer -> parser -> analyzer ->
 * IR gen -> emitter) and prints C source to stdout.
 *
 * Strict per-file imports are the default. Legacy #include fragments share a
 * compilation unit; language imports remain directed. --relaxed-imports is
 * the explicit compatibility mode that auto-composes the stdlib.
 *
 * Usage:
 *   btrcc <file.btrc>              # strict imports (default)
 *   btrcc --relaxed-imports <file.btrc> # legacy implicit stdlib visibility
 *   btrcc --no-stdlib <file.btrc>  # disable relaxed stdlib auto-composition
 *   btrcc --no-dce <file.btrc>     # preserve every emitted declaration
 *   btrcc --stdlib-dir             # print the active stdlib directory
 */

